<title>USA: Mallon Resources holders OK reverse split.</title>
<headline>Mallon Resources holders OK reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mallon Resources Corp said on Friday that its shareholders had approved a one-for-four reverse stock split, which will be effective at the stock market close on September 9.</p>
</text>
